    },
    "MissionGiver": "ArcCorp",
    "Title": "RESOURCE DRIVE: RECOVER SMALL SHIPMENT",
    "TitleKey": "GoblinG_ArcCorp_RecoverCargo_S_Title",
    "Description": "El here.\n\nBit worried about one of our contractors who\u2019s been ghosting me and hasn\u2019t completed their delivery of resources for the UEE initiative.\n\nI need someone to head out to <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> where they were last seen and bring back that cargo for us.\n\nIt was only between <EM4>50-55 SCU</EM4> of various box sizes, so it shouldn\u2019t be too hard for you to move them if you have a <EM4>tractor beam</EM4>, but that doesn\u2019t mean you should take this job lightly. I\u2019m a little worried there\u2019s a reason our pilot isn\u2019t responding. Be sure to keep an eye out for any hostiles in the area.\n\nGet the cargo to a freight elevator at: <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address|ListAll)</EM4>. I\u2019ll ensure it gets to the right place.\n\nActually, if you have another pilot with you, you might find it simpler to have one of you fly the cargo ship instead. Your call though.\n\nThanks for the assist,\n\n\nElla Tieno\nContractor Liaison Officer\nArcCorp",
    "DescriptionKey": "GoblinG_ArcCorp_RecoverCargo_S_Desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "El here.\n\nBit worried about one of our contractors who\u2019s been ghosting me and hasn\u2019t completed their delivery of resources for the UEE initiative.\n\nI need someone to head out to <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> where they were last seen and bring back that cargo for us.\n\nIt was only between <EM4>50-55 SCU</EM4> of various box sizes, so it shouldn\u2019t be too hard for you to move them if you have a <EM4>tractor beam</EM4>, but that doesn\u2019t mean you should take this job lightly. I\u2019m a little worried there\u2019s a reason our pilot isn\u2019t responding. Be sure to keep an eye out for any hostiles in the area.\n\nGet the cargo to a freight elevator at: <EM4>Area18</EM4>. I\u2019ll ensure it gets to the right place.\n\nActually, if you have another pilot with you, you might find it simpler to have one of you fly the cargo ship instead. Your call though.\n\nThanks for the assist,\n\n\nElla Tieno\nContractor Liaison Officer\nArcCorp",
